{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏風邪をこじらせて、色々ピンチでしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとかリハーサルしております！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈、すっごい鼻声です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりするくらい鼻声ですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブは、全曲披露がコンセプト。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこでやるかは言えませんが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーのカップリングの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水玉模様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈歌いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻声で歌います笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい鼻声で笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風が近づいていて、雨対策が大変な中、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ないのですが、生駒ちゃん鼻声だってことをご理解頂きたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って風邪は治しているのですが。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の生駒里奈の全力をみてくださいまし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様も、風邪には気をつけてくださいまし〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/08/27/9489112/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}